WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.043
The seeded sales table intentionally contains
multiple Laptop transactions in January A

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.601
product by month pivot has only one Laptop January
cell That

00:00:12.627 --> 00:00:18.374
means the two transaction rows must be combined If
the measure is revenue

00:00:18.624 --> 00:00:24.467
SUM is a reasonable choice But the transaction-level
detail is no longer

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.651
present in that cell
